      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0029",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Participants discovered effective sales and marketing strategies, receiving practical recommendations and addressing specific queries to optimize sales performance and enhance digital marketing tactics.",
          "_key": "k0030"
