      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0033",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "ChatGPT provided valuable perspectives on HR challenges and effective employee management techniques, covering talent acquisition, performance evaluation, training programs, and fostering a positive work culture.",
