      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0037",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "With a significant focus on AI, attendees explored the untapped potential of this game-changing technology across various industries. ChatGPT engaged in discussions about AI adoption, automation opportunities, and its potential implications on different sectors.",
