          "marks": [],
          "text": "The activation garnered a flood of positive feedback, with participants thrilled by ChatGPT’s ability to deliver relevant and valuable information. The use cases presented were versatile, making the activation relevant and beneficial to all attendees, irrespective of their industry or role.",
